[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.210",
    "end": "00:00:01.860",
    "start_seconds": 0.21,
    "end_seconds": 1.86,
    "text": "- You're going to learn some tips"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:01.860",
    "end": "00:00:03.630",
    "start_seconds": 1.86,
    "end_seconds": 3.63,
    "text": "to speak clearly and confidently."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.630",
    "end": "00:00:04.463",
    "start_seconds": 3.63,
    "end_seconds": 4.463,
    "text": "Specifically,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.463",
    "end": "00:00:06.900",
    "start_seconds": 4.463,
    "end_seconds": 6.9,
    "text": "you'll learn how to speak with more conviction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.900",
    "end": "00:00:09.540",
    "start_seconds": 6.9,
    "end_seconds": 9.54,
    "text": "This is part five in a five part series"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.540",
    "end": "00:00:11.760",
    "start_seconds": 9.54,
    "end_seconds": 11.76,
    "text": "on \"How to Speak Clearly and Confidently.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.760",
    "end": "00:00:13.230",
    "start_seconds": 11.76,
    "end_seconds": 13.23,
    "text": "This is the last video"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.230",
    "end": "00:00:16.440",
    "start_seconds": 13.23,
    "end_seconds": 16.44,
    "text": "and it's 100% compatible with every other lesson"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.440",
    "end": "00:00:17.820",
    "start_seconds": 16.44,
    "end_seconds": 17.82,
    "text": "and tip in the series."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.820",
    "end": "00:00:19.530",
    "start_seconds": 17.82,
    "end_seconds": 19.53,
    "text": "If you've been watching the series"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.530",
    "end": "00:00:21.600",
    "start_seconds": 19.53,
    "end_seconds": 21.6,
    "text": "and still haven't subscribed yet,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.600",
    "end": "00:00:23.130",
    "start_seconds": 21.6,
    "end_seconds": 23.13,
    "text": "then you can do that right now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.130",
    "end": "00:00:24.840",
    "start_seconds": 23.13,
    "end_seconds": 24.84,
    "text": "and if you're finding these lessons helpful,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.840",
    "end": "00:00:28.320",
    "start_seconds": 24.84,
    "end_seconds": 28.32,
    "text": "then feel free to check out my Communication Coach Academy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.320",
    "end": "00:00:30.791",
    "start_seconds": 28.32,
    "end_seconds": 30.791,
    "text": "We have loads of free resources there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.791",
    "end": "00:00:32.910",
    "start_seconds": 30.791,
    "end_seconds": 32.91,
    "text": "group coaching options"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.910",
    "end": "00:00:35.340",
    "start_seconds": 32.91,
    "end_seconds": 35.34,
    "text": "and a variety of classes and communication,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.340",
    "end": "00:00:37.170",
    "start_seconds": 35.34,
    "end_seconds": 37.17,
    "text": "public speaking and leadership."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.170",
    "end": "00:00:40.020",
    "start_seconds": 37.17,
    "end_seconds": 40.02,
    "text": "Today's video is all about speaking with conviction"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.020",
    "end": "00:00:43.290",
    "start_seconds": 40.02,
    "end_seconds": 43.29,
    "text": "and the bottom line is if you have something to say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.290",
    "end": "00:00:45.123",
    "start_seconds": 43.29,
    "end_seconds": 45.123,
    "text": "say it like you mean it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.123",
    "end": "00:00:48.330",
    "start_seconds": 45.123,
    "end_seconds": 48.33,
    "text": "Tip number one, to speak with more conviction"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.330",
    "end": "00:00:51.210",
    "start_seconds": 48.33,
    "end_seconds": 51.21,
    "text": "is to increase your volume."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.210",
    "end": "00:00:53.340",
    "start_seconds": 51.21,
    "end_seconds": 53.34,
    "text": "I would say that more than half of the clients"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.340",
    "end": "00:00:56.130",
    "start_seconds": 53.34,
    "end_seconds": 56.13,
    "text": "I work with do not speak loudly enough"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.130",
    "end": "00:00:59.280",
    "start_seconds": 56.13,
    "end_seconds": 59.28,
    "text": "in group situations or during presentations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.280",
    "end": "00:01:00.120",
    "start_seconds": 59.28,
    "end_seconds": 60.12,
    "text": "The trouble is,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.120",
    "end": "00:01:03.540",
    "start_seconds": 60.12,
    "end_seconds": 63.54,
    "text": "people who speak softly generally do not sound confident"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.540",
    "end": "00:01:04.860",
    "start_seconds": 63.54,
    "end_seconds": 64.86,
    "text": "in what they're saying."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.860",
    "end": "00:01:07.680",
    "start_seconds": 64.86,
    "end_seconds": 67.68,
    "text": "If you speak at a below average volume,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.680",
    "end": "00:01:10.980",
    "start_seconds": 67.68,
    "end_seconds": 70.98,
    "text": "it's going to create a below average impression."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.980",
    "end": "00:01:11.813",
    "start_seconds": 70.98,
    "end_seconds": 71.813,
    "text": "In contrast,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.813",
    "end": "00:01:14.957",
    "start_seconds": 71.813,
    "end_seconds": 74.957,
    "text": "if you can increase your volume by just 10 or 20%,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.957",
    "end": "00:01:18.180",
    "start_seconds": 74.957,
    "end_seconds": 78.18,
    "text": "everything you say will sound more enthusiastic"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.180",
    "end": "00:01:19.500",
    "start_seconds": 78.18,
    "end_seconds": 79.5,
    "text": "and committed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.500",
    "end": "00:01:21.390",
    "start_seconds": 79.5,
    "end_seconds": 81.39,
    "text": "If you're in a one-on-one conversation of course,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.390",
    "end": "00:01:25.020",
    "start_seconds": 81.39,
    "end_seconds": 85.02,
    "text": "you have to keep the level of volume conversational,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.020",
    "end": "00:01:27.720",
    "start_seconds": 85.02,
    "end_seconds": 87.72,
    "text": "but in front of a group of almost any size,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.720",
    "end": "00:01:30.780",
    "start_seconds": 87.72,
    "end_seconds": 90.78,
    "text": "increase your volume by about 10 or 20%."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.780",
    "end": "00:01:32.430",
    "start_seconds": 90.78,
    "end_seconds": 92.43,
    "text": "For public speaking the tip"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.430",
    "end": "00:01:34.710",
    "start_seconds": 92.43,
    "end_seconds": 94.71000000000001,
    "text": "is to let your voice fill the room."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.710",
    "end": "00:01:37.650",
    "start_seconds": 94.71000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 97.65,
    "text": "The larger the room and the more people that are there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.650",
    "end": "00:01:40.080",
    "start_seconds": 97.65,
    "end_seconds": 100.08,
    "text": "the more volume you use."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.080",
    "end": "00:01:41.670",
    "start_seconds": 100.08,
    "end_seconds": 101.67,
    "text": "When you speak a little louder,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.670",
    "end": "00:01:43.470",
    "start_seconds": 101.67,
    "end_seconds": 103.47,
    "text": "it'll make everything you say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.470",
    "end": "00:01:45.630",
    "start_seconds": 103.47,
    "end_seconds": 105.63,
    "text": "like you're speaking with conviction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.630",
    "end": "00:01:46.710",
    "start_seconds": 105.63,
    "end_seconds": 106.71000000000001,
    "text": "When I work with clients,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.710",
    "end": "00:01:48.360",
    "start_seconds": 106.71000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 108.36,
    "text": "we'll often do this in workshops"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.360",
    "end": "00:01:51.600",
    "start_seconds": 108.36,
    "end_seconds": 111.6,
    "text": "with somebody who is speaking too softly for the room."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.600",
    "end": "00:01:53.580",
    "start_seconds": 111.6,
    "end_seconds": 113.58,
    "text": "They volunteer and we put them up there"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.580",
    "end": "00:01:54.570",
    "start_seconds": 113.58,
    "end_seconds": 114.57,
    "text": "in front of everybody."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.570",
    "end": "00:01:55.793",
    "start_seconds": 114.57,
    "end_seconds": 115.793,
    "text": "We're really supportive"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.793",
    "end": "00:01:59.100",
    "start_seconds": 115.793,
    "end_seconds": 119.1,
    "text": "and we gradually get them to speak louder."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.100",
    "end": "00:02:01.440",
    "start_seconds": 119.1,
    "end_seconds": 121.44,
    "text": "And you can try this with me right now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.440",
    "end": "00:02:04.380",
    "start_seconds": 121.44,
    "end_seconds": 124.38,
    "text": "and I'm going to use a sample sentence about pickleball"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.380",
    "end": "00:02:06.810",
    "start_seconds": 124.38,
    "end_seconds": 126.81,
    "text": "from a previous lesson in this series."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.810",
    "end": "00:02:08.910",
    "start_seconds": 126.81,
    "end_seconds": 128.91,
    "text": "We'll gradually increase the volume"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.910",
    "end": "00:02:10.740",
    "start_seconds": 128.91,
    "end_seconds": 130.74,
    "text": "and it's just a pickleball,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.740",
    "end": "00:02:13.260",
    "start_seconds": 130.74,
    "end_seconds": 133.26,
    "text": "but you'll see how this makes a difference."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.260",
    "end": "00:02:17.850",
    "start_seconds": 133.26,
    "end_seconds": 137.85,
    "text": "Repeat the sentence after me in your normal speaking volume."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.850",
    "end": "00:02:21.153",
    "start_seconds": 137.85,
    "end_seconds": 141.153,
    "text": "Pickleball is now one of the most popular sports around."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.020",
    "end": "00:02:23.130",
    "start_seconds": 142.02,
    "end_seconds": 143.13,
    "text": "Now, let's say that again,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.130",
    "end": "00:02:26.400",
    "start_seconds": 143.13,
    "end_seconds": 146.4,
    "text": "and this time let's speak 10% louder"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.400",
    "end": "00:02:29.850",
    "start_seconds": 146.4,
    "end_seconds": 149.85,
    "text": "and let your voice start to fill whatever room you're in."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.850",
    "end": "00:02:33.720",
    "start_seconds": 149.85,
    "end_seconds": 153.72,
    "text": "Pickleball is now one of the most popular sports around."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.720",
    "end": "00:02:35.850",
    "start_seconds": 153.72,
    "end_seconds": 155.85,
    "text": "Now, let's increase the volume one more time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.850",
    "end": "00:02:39.060",
    "start_seconds": 155.85,
    "end_seconds": 159.06,
    "text": "to 20% higher than your normal volume"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.060",
    "end": "00:02:40.740",
    "start_seconds": 159.06,
    "end_seconds": 160.74,
    "text": "and say it again with me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.740",
    "end": "00:02:44.820",
    "start_seconds": 160.74,
    "end_seconds": 164.82,
    "text": "Pickleball is now one of the most popular sports around."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.820",
    "end": "00:02:45.750",
    "start_seconds": 164.82,
    "end_seconds": 165.75,
    "text": "Now, I'm not there with you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.750",
    "end": "00:02:47.219",
    "start_seconds": 165.75,
    "end_seconds": 167.219,
    "text": "but I'm willing to speculate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.219",
    "end": "00:02:49.470",
    "start_seconds": 167.219,
    "end_seconds": 169.47,
    "text": "that when you speak a little louder,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.470",
    "end": "00:02:51.390",
    "start_seconds": 169.47,
    "end_seconds": 171.39,
    "text": "you'll sound more confident"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.390",
    "end": "00:02:53.940",
    "start_seconds": 171.39,
    "end_seconds": 173.94,
    "text": "and convinced about what you just said."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.940",
    "end": "00:02:57.210",
    "start_seconds": 173.94,
    "end_seconds": 177.21,
    "text": "You may also notice as you practice speaking louder,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.210",
    "end": "00:02:58.170",
    "start_seconds": 177.21,
    "end_seconds": 178.17000000000002,
    "text": "that you're benefiting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.170",
    "end": "00:03:00.840",
    "start_seconds": 178.17000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 180.84,
    "text": "from a few other positive side effects."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.840",
    "end": "00:03:01.860",
    "start_seconds": 180.84,
    "end_seconds": 181.86,
    "text": "I've noticed that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.860",
    "end": "00:03:04.710",
    "start_seconds": 181.86,
    "end_seconds": 184.71,
    "text": "when most of my clients increase their volume,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.710",
    "end": "00:03:07.380",
    "start_seconds": 184.71,
    "end_seconds": 187.38,
    "text": "they also increase their vocal variety"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.380",
    "end": "00:03:08.460",
    "start_seconds": 187.38,
    "end_seconds": 188.46,
    "text": "in the sound of their voice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.460",
    "end": "00:03:10.530",
    "start_seconds": 188.46,
    "end_seconds": 190.53,
    "text": "So, they no longer sound monotone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:10.530",
    "end": "00:03:13.530",
    "start_seconds": 190.53,
    "end_seconds": 193.53,
    "text": "That's because increasing your volume naturally,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.530",
    "end": "00:03:15.960",
    "start_seconds": 193.53,
    "end_seconds": 195.96,
    "text": "improves your tone and inflection."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.960",
    "end": "00:03:18.870",
    "start_seconds": 195.96,
    "end_seconds": 198.87,
    "text": "My clients also usually start to become more animated"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.870",
    "end": "00:03:21.240",
    "start_seconds": 198.87,
    "end_seconds": 201.24,
    "text": "in terms of their gestures in their body language"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.240",
    "end": "00:03:22.800",
    "start_seconds": 201.24,
    "end_seconds": 202.8,
    "text": "and their facial expressions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.800",
    "end": "00:03:24.750",
    "start_seconds": 202.8,
    "end_seconds": 204.75,
    "text": "I can't obviously see you right now,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.750",
    "end": "00:03:26.580",
    "start_seconds": 204.75,
    "end_seconds": 206.57999999999998,
    "text": "but let me ask, did you notice"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.580",
    "end": "00:03:29.700",
    "start_seconds": 206.57999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 209.7,
    "text": "that your facial expressions became more animated"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.700",
    "end": "00:03:31.590",
    "start_seconds": 209.7,
    "end_seconds": 211.59,
    "text": "when you increased your volume?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.590",
    "end": "00:03:35.250",
    "start_seconds": 211.59,
    "end_seconds": 215.25,
    "text": "Did you gesture with your hands without realizing it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.250",
    "end": "00:03:38.040",
    "start_seconds": 215.25,
    "end_seconds": 218.04,
    "text": "All of that will make you come across as more confident"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.040",
    "end": "00:03:39.390",
    "start_seconds": 218.04,
    "end_seconds": 219.39,
    "text": "in what you're saying."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.390",
    "end": "00:03:42.000",
    "start_seconds": 219.39,
    "end_seconds": 222.0,
    "text": "So, all you have to do is increase your volume"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.000",
    "end": "00:03:43.740",
    "start_seconds": 222.0,
    "end_seconds": 223.74,
    "text": "by about 10% or 20%"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.740",
    "end": "00:03:46.260",
    "start_seconds": 223.74,
    "end_seconds": 226.26,
    "text": "and you'll look and sound like you're speaking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.260",
    "end": "00:03:47.699",
    "start_seconds": 226.26,
    "end_seconds": 227.699,
    "text": "with more conviction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.699",
    "end": "00:03:50.488",
    "start_seconds": 227.699,
    "end_seconds": 230.488,
    "text": "Tip number two to speak with more conviction"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.488",
    "end": "00:03:55.470",
    "start_seconds": 230.488,
    "end_seconds": 235.47,
    "text": "is to emphasize the most important words in each sentence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.470",
    "end": "00:03:57.690",
    "start_seconds": 235.47,
    "end_seconds": 237.69,
    "text": "In fact, I just did that in my previous sentence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.690",
    "end": "00:03:58.920",
    "start_seconds": 237.69,
    "end_seconds": 238.92000000000002,
    "text": "so I'll do it again"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.920",
    "end": "00:04:02.070",
    "start_seconds": 238.92000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 242.07,
    "text": "and you tell me which words I emphasized."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.070",
    "end": "00:04:03.540",
    "start_seconds": 242.07,
    "end_seconds": 243.54,
    "text": "To speak with more conviction,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.540",
    "end": "00:04:07.950",
    "start_seconds": 243.54,
    "end_seconds": 247.95,
    "text": "emphasize the most important words in each sentence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.950",
    "end": "00:04:09.120",
    "start_seconds": 247.95,
    "end_seconds": 249.12,
    "text": "Did you hear it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.120",
    "end": "00:04:10.410",
    "start_seconds": 249.12,
    "end_seconds": 250.41,
    "text": "And you can do the same."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.410",
    "end": "00:04:14.220",
    "start_seconds": 250.41,
    "end_seconds": 254.22,
    "text": "All I did was slow down and lean into what I consider"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.220",
    "end": "00:04:16.350",
    "start_seconds": 254.22,
    "end_seconds": 256.35,
    "text": "to be the most important words,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.350",
    "end": "00:04:19.470",
    "start_seconds": 256.35,
    "end_seconds": 259.47,
    "text": "and you should do that in every single sentence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.470",
    "end": "00:04:22.410",
    "start_seconds": 259.47,
    "end_seconds": 262.41,
    "text": "Just pick whatever two or three words in a row"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.410",
    "end": "00:04:23.910",
    "start_seconds": 262.41,
    "end_seconds": 263.91,
    "text": "that matter the most in each sentence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.910",
    "end": "00:04:26.940",
    "start_seconds": 263.91,
    "end_seconds": 266.94,
    "text": "Slow down and add emphasis to them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.940",
    "end": "00:04:30.030",
    "start_seconds": 266.94,
    "end_seconds": 270.03,
    "text": "There are lots of reasons to emphasize key words."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.030",
    "end": "00:04:32.400",
    "start_seconds": 270.03,
    "end_seconds": 272.4,
    "text": "The first is that when people speak too rapidly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.400",
    "end": "00:04:34.890",
    "start_seconds": 272.4,
    "end_seconds": 274.89,
    "text": "and rush through every thought and every sentence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.890",
    "end": "00:04:36.330",
    "start_seconds": 274.89,
    "end_seconds": 276.33,
    "text": "it doesn't sound confident."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.330",
    "end": "00:04:39.450",
    "start_seconds": 276.33,
    "end_seconds": 279.45,
    "text": "It sounds like they're just trying to get through a message"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.450",
    "end": "00:04:42.120",
    "start_seconds": 279.45,
    "end_seconds": 282.12,
    "text": "and their main goal is to get it over with."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.120",
    "end": "00:04:45.270",
    "start_seconds": 282.12,
    "end_seconds": 285.27,
    "text": "Now, rushing through may help you accomplish the goal"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.270",
    "end": "00:04:47.460",
    "start_seconds": 285.27,
    "end_seconds": 287.46,
    "text": "of finishing as fast as possible,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.460",
    "end": "00:04:49.140",
    "start_seconds": 287.46,
    "end_seconds": 289.14,
    "text": "but it's not going to make you sound,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.140",
    "end": "00:04:51.300",
    "start_seconds": 289.14,
    "end_seconds": 291.3,
    "text": "like you believe what you're saying."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.300",
    "end": "00:04:55.470",
    "start_seconds": 291.3,
    "end_seconds": 295.47,
    "text": "Another reason people rush is because of anxiety and nerves,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.470",
    "end": "00:04:58.020",
    "start_seconds": 295.47,
    "end_seconds": 298.02,
    "text": "but whatever reason you have for speaking too quickly,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.020",
    "end": "00:05:00.870",
    "start_seconds": 298.02,
    "end_seconds": 300.87,
    "text": "emphasizing the most important words in each"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:00.870",
    "end": "00:05:02.640",
    "start_seconds": 300.87,
    "end_seconds": 302.64,
    "text": "and every sentence will give you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.640",
    "end": "00:05:05.250",
    "start_seconds": 302.64,
    "end_seconds": 305.25,
    "text": "a much more confident sounding rhythm."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.250",
    "end": "00:05:06.390",
    "start_seconds": 305.25,
    "end_seconds": 306.39,
    "text": "It also helps your listeners,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.390",
    "end": "00:05:07.854",
    "start_seconds": 306.39,
    "end_seconds": 307.854,
    "text": "because now they know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.854",
    "end": "00:05:10.140",
    "start_seconds": 307.854,
    "end_seconds": 310.14,
    "text": "that if it's important to you as a speaker,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.140",
    "end": "00:05:12.990",
    "start_seconds": 310.14,
    "end_seconds": 312.99,
    "text": "then you're signaling that it should be important to them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.990",
    "end": "00:05:15.030",
    "start_seconds": 312.99,
    "end_seconds": 315.03,
    "text": "And here's another tip within a tip."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.030",
    "end": "00:05:17.430",
    "start_seconds": 315.03,
    "end_seconds": 317.43,
    "text": "When you get to the end of your talking turn,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.430",
    "end": "00:05:20.220",
    "start_seconds": 317.43,
    "end_seconds": 320.22,
    "text": "make sure you use the same type of emphasis"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.220",
    "end": "00:05:23.190",
    "start_seconds": 320.22,
    "end_seconds": 323.19,
    "text": "on the last three words you say"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.190",
    "end": "00:05:26.490",
    "start_seconds": 323.19,
    "end_seconds": 326.49,
    "text": "and make sure your voice goes down at the end,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.490",
    "end": "00:05:29.040",
    "start_seconds": 326.49,
    "end_seconds": 329.04,
    "text": "toward the period punctuation mark."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.040",
    "end": "00:05:31.470",
    "start_seconds": 329.04,
    "end_seconds": 331.47,
    "text": "It should sound like you are landing the plane"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.470",
    "end": "00:05:32.940",
    "start_seconds": 331.47,
    "end_seconds": 332.94,
    "text": "on your talking turn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.940",
    "end": "00:05:34.920",
    "start_seconds": 332.94,
    "end_seconds": 334.92,
    "text": "Let's use our pickleball example again"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.920",
    "end": "00:05:36.360",
    "start_seconds": 334.92,
    "end_seconds": 336.36,
    "text": "and say it along with me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:36.360",
    "end": "00:05:39.450",
    "start_seconds": 336.36,
    "end_seconds": 339.45,
    "text": "We'll pretend that this is the end of our talking turn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.450",
    "end": "00:05:42.270",
    "start_seconds": 339.45,
    "end_seconds": 342.27,
    "text": "Emphasize the last three words as you read this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.270",
    "end": "00:05:44.790",
    "start_seconds": 342.27,
    "end_seconds": 344.79,
    "text": "and notice how certain you sound."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.790",
    "end": "00:05:48.990",
    "start_seconds": 344.79,
    "end_seconds": 348.99,
    "text": "Pickleball is now one of the most popular sports around."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.990",
    "end": "00:05:51.150",
    "start_seconds": 348.99,
    "end_seconds": 351.15,
    "text": "You really wanna lean into those last three words."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.150",
    "end": "00:05:53.940",
    "start_seconds": 351.15,
    "end_seconds": 353.94,
    "text": "Make sure it sounds like you're making a statement"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:53.940",
    "end": "00:05:56.190",
    "start_seconds": 353.94,
    "end_seconds": 356.19,
    "text": "and not asking a question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.190",
    "end": "00:05:58.230",
    "start_seconds": 356.19,
    "end_seconds": 358.23,
    "text": "Third, let's talk eye contact"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.230",
    "end": "00:05:59.970",
    "start_seconds": 358.23,
    "end_seconds": 359.97,
    "text": "and how you can use this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.970",
    "end": "00:06:01.740",
    "start_seconds": 359.97,
    "end_seconds": 361.74,
    "text": "to come across as more confident,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.740",
    "end": "00:06:04.470",
    "start_seconds": 361.74,
    "end_seconds": 364.47,
    "text": "like you really believe what you just said."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.470",
    "end": "00:06:05.580",
    "start_seconds": 364.47,
    "end_seconds": 365.58,
    "text": "Before I give you this tip,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.580",
    "end": "00:06:08.100",
    "start_seconds": 365.58,
    "end_seconds": 368.1,
    "text": "let me explain how I learned this myself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.100",
    "end": "00:06:10.710",
    "start_seconds": 368.1,
    "end_seconds": 370.71,
    "text": "I've been going to group meetings as a participant"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.710",
    "end": "00:06:13.050",
    "start_seconds": 370.71,
    "end_seconds": 373.05,
    "text": "and coaching clients for decades now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.050",
    "end": "00:06:15.660",
    "start_seconds": 373.05,
    "end_seconds": 375.66,
    "text": "and I've noticed a very subtle behavior"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.660",
    "end": "00:06:18.360",
    "start_seconds": 375.66,
    "end_seconds": 378.36,
    "text": "that differentiates the most confident speakers"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:18.360",
    "end": "00:06:20.400",
    "start_seconds": 378.36,
    "end_seconds": 380.4,
    "text": "from everybody else in the room."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.400",
    "end": "00:06:21.870",
    "start_seconds": 380.4,
    "end_seconds": 381.87,
    "text": "First and most obviously,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.870",
    "end": "00:06:24.540",
    "start_seconds": 381.87,
    "end_seconds": 384.54,
    "text": "confident speakers tend to make direct eye contact"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.540",
    "end": "00:06:26.280",
    "start_seconds": 384.54,
    "end_seconds": 386.28,
    "text": "with people as they're speaking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.280",
    "end": "00:06:28.890",
    "start_seconds": 386.28,
    "end_seconds": 388.89,
    "text": "That's probably not too surprising"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.890",
    "end": "00:06:31.020",
    "start_seconds": 388.89,
    "end_seconds": 391.02,
    "text": "and I would guess like most people,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.020",
    "end": "00:06:33.750",
    "start_seconds": 391.02,
    "end_seconds": 393.75,
    "text": "you make at least some direct eye contact"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.750",
    "end": "00:06:35.580",
    "start_seconds": 393.75,
    "end_seconds": 395.58,
    "text": "when you're speaking, but if you don't,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.580",
    "end": "00:06:37.961",
    "start_seconds": 395.58,
    "end_seconds": 397.961,
    "text": "make sure you practice eye contact,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.961",
    "end": "00:06:40.230",
    "start_seconds": 397.961,
    "end_seconds": 400.23,
    "text": "while you're speaking and sharing your message."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.230",
    "end": "00:06:41.063",
    "start_seconds": 400.23,
    "end_seconds": 401.063,
    "text": "A second,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.063",
    "end": "00:06:44.340",
    "start_seconds": 401.063,
    "end_seconds": 404.34000000000003,
    "text": "here's the subtle difference I noticed about eye contact."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.340",
    "end": "00:06:47.670",
    "start_seconds": 404.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 407.67,
    "text": "When the most confident speakers finish their talking turns,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:47.670",
    "end": "00:06:50.724",
    "start_seconds": 407.67,
    "end_seconds": 410.724,
    "text": "they keep their eyes and their chin up"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:50.724",
    "end": "00:06:54.660",
    "start_seconds": 410.724,
    "end_seconds": 414.65999999999997,
    "text": "and they continue to make eye contact with the next person"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.660",
    "end": "00:06:56.280",
    "start_seconds": 414.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 416.28,
    "text": "in the group who speaks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.280",
    "end": "00:06:59.640",
    "start_seconds": 416.28,
    "end_seconds": 419.64,
    "text": "They don't stare or glare at the next person"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.640",
    "end": "00:07:00.930",
    "start_seconds": 419.64,
    "end_seconds": 420.93,
    "text": "in a confrontational way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.930",
    "end": "00:07:05.100",
    "start_seconds": 420.93,
    "end_seconds": 425.1,
    "text": "They simply maintain eye contact with whoever speaks next."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.100",
    "end": "00:07:08.670",
    "start_seconds": 425.1,
    "end_seconds": 428.67,
    "text": "In contrast, professionals who seem to lack confidence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.670",
    "end": "00:07:09.840",
    "start_seconds": 428.67,
    "end_seconds": 429.84,
    "text": "in what they said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.840",
    "end": "00:07:12.960",
    "start_seconds": 429.84,
    "end_seconds": 432.96,
    "text": "finish their talking turn and then they drop their eyes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.960",
    "end": "00:07:14.820",
    "start_seconds": 432.96,
    "end_seconds": 434.82,
    "text": "and their chin toward the table,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.820",
    "end": "00:07:17.040",
    "start_seconds": 434.82,
    "end_seconds": 437.04,
    "text": "toward their notes or toward a device."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.040",
    "end": "00:07:18.900",
    "start_seconds": 437.04,
    "end_seconds": 438.9,
    "text": "And when they break eye contact like that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.900",
    "end": "00:07:20.670",
    "start_seconds": 438.9,
    "end_seconds": 440.67,
    "text": "and look down after they speak,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.670",
    "end": "00:07:23.640",
    "start_seconds": 440.67,
    "end_seconds": 443.64,
    "text": "it creates the impression that they don't believe in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.640",
    "end": "00:07:26.250",
    "start_seconds": 443.64,
    "end_seconds": 446.25,
    "text": "or stand behind what they just said."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.250",
    "end": "00:07:27.390",
    "start_seconds": 446.25,
    "end_seconds": 447.39,
    "text": "To reiterate the tip,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:27.390",
    "end": "00:07:30.480",
    "start_seconds": 447.39,
    "end_seconds": 450.48,
    "text": "when you finish your talking turn in a group situation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.480",
    "end": "00:07:32.190",
    "start_seconds": 450.48,
    "end_seconds": 452.19,
    "text": "keep your chin up,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.190",
    "end": "00:07:35.520",
    "start_seconds": 452.19,
    "end_seconds": 455.52,
    "text": "maintain eye contact with whoever speaks next"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.520",
    "end": "00:07:38.070",
    "start_seconds": 455.52,
    "end_seconds": 458.07,
    "text": "and it will cast a very positive light"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.070",
    "end": "00:07:39.840",
    "start_seconds": 458.07,
    "end_seconds": 459.84000000000003,
    "text": "on what you just said"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.840",
    "end": "00:07:43.385",
    "start_seconds": 459.84000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 463.385,
    "text": "and it'll come across like you stand behind your message."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.385",
    "end": "00:07:46.050",
    "start_seconds": 463.385,
    "end_seconds": 466.05,
    "text": "If you watched all five videos in this series"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.050",
    "end": "00:07:48.090",
    "start_seconds": 466.05,
    "end_seconds": 468.09000000000003,
    "text": "on how to speak clearly and confidently,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.090",
    "end": "00:07:49.920",
    "start_seconds": 468.09000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 469.92,
    "text": "please let me know in a comment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:49.920",
    "end": "00:07:53.040",
    "start_seconds": 469.92,
    "end_seconds": 473.04,
    "text": "I would love to celebrate that with you with my own comment,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:53.040",
    "end": "00:07:54.780",
    "start_seconds": 473.04,
    "end_seconds": 474.78,
    "text": "and I will give you a heart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:54.780",
    "end": "00:07:57.000",
    "start_seconds": 474.78,
    "end_seconds": 477.0,
    "text": "And don't forget to take a look at my website."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:57.000",
    "end": "00:08:00.030",
    "start_seconds": 477.0,
    "end_seconds": 480.03,
    "text": "There's free resources there that I mentioned,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:00.030",
    "end": "00:08:02.910",
    "start_seconds": 480.03,
    "end_seconds": 482.91,
    "text": "group coaching options and classes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.910",
    "end": "00:08:04.950",
    "start_seconds": 482.91,
    "end_seconds": 484.95,
    "text": "Thank you for joining me in this journey."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:04.950",
    "end": "00:08:05.940",
    "start_seconds": 484.95,
    "end_seconds": 485.94,
    "text": "Until next time, thanks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:05.940",
    "end": "00:08:07.690",
    "start_seconds": 485.94,
    "end_seconds": 487.69,
    "text": "God bless, and I will see you soon."
  }
]
